      "channel_effects": null,
      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Yes—I can help, but I need to first verify your account and identify the correct order/items.\n\n1) **Please share your email address** (used to look up your account).\n2) **What is the order ID** you’re referring to? (e.g., `#W0000000`)\n3) Are **the hose + backpack + hiking boots all in the same order**, or are they from **different orders**?\n\nAlso, quick heads-up: in our system, **returns and exchanges are handled separately for delivered orders**, so if everything is in the *same* order, I may need to coordinate with a human agent to get both done correctly. Once I confirm your order and item ids, I’ll tell you the exact next step.",
